{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Cryptid Keeper.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, the wilderness, and things that shouldn\u2019t exist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track, catch, and collect cryptids and aliens. Manage your own Cryptid Zoo, care for your creatures, and attract visitors while exploring the wild to discover new and mysterious Cryptid species add to your Index!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At it's core, a Monster Collector, but with so much more...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Embark on a curious adventure from your base-camp, where you'll radar-scan and hunt for Cryptids, Monsters and Aliens!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0View and manage your Cryptid Index, craft hunting resources, view your Zoo stats and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/93c22a38b335ac32160800fce9856900.poster.avif?t=1757898908\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/93c22a38b335ac32160800fce9856900.webm?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/93c22a38b335ac32160800fce9856900.mp4?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use traps, radar pings and keen observation skills to track down and capture these elusive creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/1b1909419729bfadc0a582ceb22eb147.avif?t=1757898908\" width=695 height=76 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why? To add them to your Zoo of course! Open the gates, charge the visitors, maintain, feed, store and display your Cryptids.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/1ab2e086d829f01fce2a254b8b7d151e.poster.avif?t=1757898908\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/1ab2e086d829f01fce2a254b8b7d151e.webm?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/1ab2e086d829f01fce2a254b8b7d151e.mp4?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to sort your Aliens in the Cosmos Center, making sure they have the correct atmosphere for their enclosures, enough food in their bellies to keep them co-operative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/f0ee82042a8104bc256967d206889c9b.poster.avif?t=1757898908\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/f0ee82042a8104bc256967d206889c9b.webm?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/f0ee82042a8104bc256967d206889c9b.mp4?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of cryptids, a lover of cosy games, or simply in need of a witty adventure, you'll find joy in discovering and caring for your collection of cryptid companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.poster.avif?t=1757898908\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.webm?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.mp4?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cryptid Hunting:</strong> Scan and search for cryptids, then find them on the Map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise Your Zoo:</strong> Capture cryptids and house them in your very own charming zoo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection &amp; Discovery:\u00a0 </strong>Find\u00a0new cryptids and uncover their unique traits and behaviours. Explore the map, stumble upon strange encounters, investigate your radar-pings, set and bait traps, visit enterable locations, pick berries and leaves to craft items, find hunter caches and scavenge items, get ambushed by a Sasquatch... What will you find?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/845a9b91a147d30c42325c0cff63674f.avif?t=1757898908\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on a fun  journey through the world of cryptids! The creatures are waiting for you to find them. <strong>Can you capture them all?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667060?t=1757898908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/dc08a6027cb9ed641743cb790420b94a8c150f68/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757898908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/6989bf8d5c58c2b814a59f653e2156ba0e491e6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757898908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/6989bf8d5c58c2b814a59f653e2156ba0e491e6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757898908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Cryptid Keeper.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, the wilderness, and things that shouldn\u2019t exist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track, catch, and collect cryptids and aliens. Manage your own Cryptid Zoo, care for your creatures, and attract visitors while exploring the wild to discover new and mysterious Cryptid species add to your Index!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At it's core, a Monster Collector, but with so much more...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Embark on a curious adventure from your base-camp, where you'll radar-scan and hunt for Cryptids, Monsters and Aliens!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0View and manage your Cryptid Index, craft hunting resources, view your Zoo stats and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/93c22a38b335ac32160800fce9856900.poster.avif?t=1757898908\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://sha