tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/f0ee82042a8104bc256967d206889c9b.poster.avif?t=1757898908\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/f0ee82042a8104bc256967d206889c9b.webm?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/f0ee82042a8104bc256967d206889c9b.mp4?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of cryptids, a lover of cosy games, or simply in need of a witty adventure, you'll find joy in discovering and caring for your collection of cryptid companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.poster.avif?t=1757898908\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.webm?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/e29a0d9121418581275953817b342539.mp4?t=1757898908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cryptid Hunting:</strong> Scan and search for cryptids, then find them on the Map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise Your Zoo:</strong> Capture cryptids and house them in your very own charming zoo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection &amp; Discovery:\u00a0 </strong>Find\u00a0new cryptids and uncover their unique traits and behaviours. Explore the map, stumble upon strange encounters, investigate your radar-pings, set and bait traps, visit enterable locations, pick berries and leaves to craft items, find hunter caches and scavenge items, get ambushed by a Sasquatch... What will you find?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/845a9b91a147d30c42325c0cff63674f.avif?t=1757898908\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on a fun  journey through the world of cryptids! The creatures are waiting for you to find them. <strong>Can you capture them all?</strong></p>","developers":["Double Jackdaw"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/930286c631cfa1d3baf7f6ea4e8b7f6d8b15662a/header.jpg?t=1757898908","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Double Jackdaw. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152556,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152556/movie480.mp4?t=1749245937","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152556/movie_max.mp4?t=1749245937"},"name":"Cryptid Keeper - Steam Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152556/711f9586ba86048b96d909cbf449c32349e606b2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749245937","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152556/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749245937","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152556/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749